From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sm64ar <sm64ar@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Original save dialogs

Saving is upstream's again in AR mode:

- a star or key is saved when it is collected (interaction.c, unchanged);
- a star exit lands Mario with the course-done screen and its menu
  (Save & Continue / Continue, Don't Save);
- a star that keeps Mario in the level asks "Save?".

interaction.c is upstream's; mario_actions_cutscene.c keeps only the
viewer-relative control yaw. save_file_do_save counts its calls, with
the course and star last completed (gArSaveCount, gArSaveCourse,
gArSaveStar), so the host can log saves; that is bookkeeping only.
---
 src/game/ar_game_hooks.h          |  7 ++++---
 src/game/interaction.c            |  3 ---
 src/game/mario_actions_cutscene.c | 19 ++++++-------------
 src/game/save_file.c              | 12 +++++-------
 4 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/game/ar_game_hooks.h b/src/game/ar_game_hooks.h
index 570e8ca..99b7767 100644
--- a/src/game/ar_game_hooks.h
+++ b/src/game/ar_game_hooks.h
@@ -27,9 +27,10 @@ extern struct ArGameHooks *gArGameHooks;
  * any warp moves Mario. Area 0 until a level script sets it. */
 extern s16 gArLevelEntryPos[3];
 extern s8 gArLevelEntryArea;
-extern u32 gArAutoSaveCount;
-extern u8 gArAutoSaveCourse, gArAutoSaveStar;
-void ar_note_auto_save(void);
+/* Bookkeeping only, so the host can log saves: every save_file_do_save call is counted, with the course and star last
+ * completed at that moment (save_file.c). Saving itself is upstream's. */
+extern u32 gArSaveCount;
+extern u8 gArSaveCourse, gArSaveStar;
 /* with gArMode, called after a save file was erased (src -1, dst the erased file index) or copied (src to dst),
  * so the host's per-file sidecars follow the slot. NULL = none (upstream). */
 extern void (*gArSaveFileEvent)(s32 src, s32 dst);
diff --git a/src/game/interaction.c b/src/game/interaction.c
index 752ef4a..a102e8c 100644
--- a/src/game/interaction.c
+++ b/src/game/interaction.c
@@ -32,8 +32,6 @@
